PTIONAL DATA TO WRITE. FOR STREAMS NOT OPERATING IN OBJECT MODE, CHUNK MUST 
BE A {STRING}, {BUFFER}, {TYPEDARRAY} OR {DATAVIEW}. FOR OBJECT MODE STREAMS, 
CHUNK MAY BE ANY JAVASCRIPT VALUE OTHER THAN NULL.


THE WRITABLE.WRITE() METHOD WRITES SOME DATA TO THE
 STREAM, AND CALLS THE SUPPLIED CALLBACK ONCE THE DATA HAS BEEN FULL
 Y HANDLED. IF AN ERROR OCCURS, THE CALLBACK WILL BE CALLED WITH THE ER

ROR AS ITS FIRST ARGUMENT. THE CALLBACK IS CALLED ASYNCHRONOUSLY AND BEFORE 'ERROR' IS EMITTED.